    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to the Workshop</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Rat King Recon runs on your feet. Every step you take out in the world earns EXP toward your next rat, and Scrap to spend on gear.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_hatch_title">Walk to Hatch</string>
    <string name="onboarding_hatch_body">Your phone counts your steps in the background, even with the app shut. Fill the EXP bar and the egg splits open — a new rat is yours.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_ledger_title">The Rat Ledger</string>
    <string name="onboarding_ledger_body">Every rat you hatch is written into the Ledger. Sort by Power, filter for shinies, and fill the collection out — there are 32 species to find.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_fight_title">Fuse and Fight</string>
    <string name="onboarding_fight_body">Feed two weak rats to the Fusion Pot to mint a stronger mutant. Out walking, Rustbots will block your path — fight one yourself, or settle it straight from the notification.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_ready_title">Ready to Roll</string>
    <string name="onboarding_ready_body">That is everything. Get walking, and your first rat will not be far off.</string>

